e secrets are said to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lords of the five kingdoms, who have come from the five worlds to the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from the five worlds to the Castle in the Sky, wishing to return to their original worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lords of the five kingdoms who have moved from the five worlds to the Celestial Castle in hopes of returning to their original worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;sixth seeker&quot; suddenly appears in the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, a mysterious dungeon gate also appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has lost her memory, and all she remembers is that she has to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is that she must go to the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the underground gate,\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and then through the Abyss to reach the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus began her journey through the Abyss.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dungeon known as the Abyss has suddenly appeared. To open the &quot;Door of Darkness&quot; at its deepest point, the Seeker plunges into the dungeon gate... in search of the truth. Survive the onslaught of dark forces in this twin-stick survival shooter! \u2014 Are You Ready to Face Your Destiny?",
